    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Lab 1: Brainstorming Ideas\"\ncode-fold: true\ncode-link: true\nformat: html\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n### Group Assignment\n\nYou will be working in a group this semester. You will develop a project, gather measures, find background literature, collect data, analyze results, all culminating in a final paper.\n\nHow do *you* think groups should be decided?\n\n1.  What if we clustered groups together by GPA? (consider using means clustering from `{cluster}` package.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmeth1 <- \n  data.frame(\n  student = 1:20,\n  gpa = c(rnorm(5,3.4,.3),\n              rnorm(5,3.0,.3),\n              rnorm(5,2.2,1),\n              rnorm(5,2.5,.5))\n) \n\n#cluster::agnes(meth1, metric = \"euclidean\", method = \"average\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n2.  What if we sorted groups alphabetically?\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndf_test <- \n  data.frame(\n  student = paste0(\n    sample(babynames$name,30), \" \", sample(LETTERS,30,replace = T), \".\"\n))\n\nnum_gr <- 5\n\ncolname <- paste0(\"Group \", 1:5)\n\ndf_abc <- \n  df_test |> \n  group_by((row_number()-1) %/% (n()/num_gr)) |> \n  tidyr::nest()\n\ndf_abc_d <- \n  df_abc$data |> \n  as.data.frame() |> \n  hux() |> \n  theme_article()\n\ndf_abc_d[1,1:5] <- colname\n\ndf_abc_d |> \n  set_left_border() |> \n  set_caption(\"Study Groups\")\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<table class=\"huxtable\" data-quarto-disable-processing=\"true\"  style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<caption style=\"caption-side: top; text-align: center;\">Study Groups</caption><col><col><col><col><col><thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"huxtable-cell huxtable-header\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 6pt 6pt 0pt;\">Group 1</th><th class=\"huxtable-cell huxtable-header\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt;\">Group 2</th><th class=\"huxtable-cell huxtable-header\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt;\">Group 3</th><th class=\"huxtable-cell huxtable-header\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt 0.4pt;\">Group 4</th><th class=\"huxtable-cell huxtable-header\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 0pt 6pt 6pt;\">Group 5</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 6pt 6pt 0pt;\">Simrah J.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Jeslynn Y.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Aizlyn Z.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Mariadejesus D.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0.4pt 0pt 0pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 0pt 6pt 6pt;\">Kymir S.</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 6pt 6pt 0pt;\">Ijeoma Z.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Hindy K.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Comfort N.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;\">Reinhold H.</td><td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6pt 0pt 6pt 6pt;\">Reese B.</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"huxtable-cell\" style=\"border-style: solid solid solid solid; border-width: 0pt 0.4pt 0pt 0.4pt;    padding: 6p